fn wclear to void
put wn 0 0
end
fn wadd s view uchar * to void
if ge add get wn 0 len s 1024
die 2
end
for i ulong len s
put wb add get wn 0 i get s i
end
put wn 0 add get wn 0 len s
end
fn wfield f ulong to void
